{
  "record": "MEASURE_CLASS_TAXONOMY/1.0.0",
  "note": [
    "The canonical measure-class taxonomy (R103, claim c-0117; the AM89",
    "directive-1 enforcement surface). Every class is a family of",
    "intervention measures with shared procurement/actuation semantics.",
    "A measure row is IN-SET iff one of its SUBSTANTIVE classes appears",
    "in the problem's permitted set; the PARAMETER_TUNING modifier never",
    "rescues an out-of-set substantive object (retuning a forbidden",
    "variable is still a forbidden measure); VEHICLE classes (control",
    "configuration over existing equipment, monitoring, documentation,",
    "burden annotations) ride whatever measure they implement and never",
    "kill. Markers are hyphen-insensitive, word-boundary matched,",
    "multi-word phrases before singles. Calibrated on the burned-v14",
    "water corpus + the v4/v5 pinned bytes (the sole true fire is",
    "HO14-12; see eval/r103_allowed_measures_calibration.json)."
  ],
